技术与仪器/自动化/电气/计算机等相关专业，有1年及以上PLC或者自动化测试经验，有过自动化开发经验者优先；\n2、会Python基础语法、数据结构、函数；熟练使用ST、LD编程语言；熟悉PLC核心硬件及组成架构，熟悉总线任务；\n3、会使用软件抓包工具；具备C语言能力\n4、了解各品牌的PLC；会IDE使用（PyCharm、VS Code等）会面向对象编程、模块与包等知识\n5、硬件电路原理等基本专业知识；会使用万用表，示波器，信号发生器等工具；\n6、有责任心，主动性强，有一定抗压能力，具备团队合作精神。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"1-3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-06-14T13:10:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"1d976c1d-722b-473a-bd41-b8dbc2729d8a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270664712,"PostDateInt":1710225101000,"PostDate":"2024-03-12T14:31:41","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"上位机软件工程师(J10135)","OrgId":1030789,"Org":"HMI软件研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·无锡市"],"Salary":"10K-14K 元/月","Duty":"1.根据产品需求进行PC端人机交互软件（上位机）开发\n2.熟悉NET架构, 熟悉winform，多线程编程，数据库操作熟练\n3.深刻理解TCP/IP通讯，熟悉TCP/IP协议栈\n4.熟悉git源代码管理工具","Require":"1、统招本科及以上学历，计算机软件相关专业，具有3年左右C# winform相关开发经验；\n2、掌握C#-winform、git管理、gtest、操作系统原理；\n3、熟练掌握抓包、VS断点调试和内存分析相关的技能；\n4、熟悉多线程和并发编程、熟悉常用的设计模式；\n5、具有高度的责任心和良好的沟通能力，学习意愿强，具有钻研精神，对技术领域有浓厚的兴趣和学习欲望；\n5、有过软件模式设计的相关经验优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-03-12T14:31:41","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"37b3ec4c-77a2-48a0-90f4-8be8b145fa45","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270658814,"PostDateInt":1709181026000,"PostDate":"2024-02-29T12:30:26","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"算法工程师（温控/称重）(J10116)","OrgId":1030795,"Org":"过程控制研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·无锡市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"岗位职责：\n（1）负责过程控制产品，如温度、称重、压力、流体相关过程控制算法和产品开发以及自测质量的保证，并完成开发文档的整理工作；\n（2）负责维护和优化现有产品算法，保证现有产品算法质量；\n（3）负责市场性能问题分析定位和解决，参与竞品分析比较，提升产品算法性能指标；\n（4）负责前沿过程控制算法/课题理论预先研究（包含调研、仿真、开发与测试等全阶段开发进程）；\n（5）协助产品推广的复杂问题解决、产品应用落地等，参与过程控制项目的现场调试和验证，满足产品在不同场景的性能要求。","Require":"基础要求：\n1、学历：统招本科及以上学历，计算机/电子/电气/自动化/机械/控制等相关专业；\n2、熟练使用 C 语言编程，熟练掌握 matlab/Simulink 软件使用，熟练使用 ST/LD编程语言；\n3、精通经典控制理论与现代控制理论，注重理论联系实际，具备运用各类理论进行系统建模、控制设计、问题分析等的能力；\n4、精通信号处理方法，掌握信号提取、变换、分析、综合应用的能力；\n5、熟悉经典过程控制算法与先进过程控制算法；\n6、数学基础扎实，算法原理深入性突出，创新思维独特，工作踏实，有责任心，富有强烈的进取心和钻研精神；\n称重方向：\n1、熟悉国内外主流称重仪表/产品，具备调研分析、汇总能力；\n2、精通信号处理方法，数学与物理原理扎实，掌握基础的机械结构、理论力学、材料力学、统计/概率学等方面知识；\n3、具备一定的电路知识，掌握称重电路/原理、称重功能等基本知识与技能；\n4、对于信号获取、干扰分析、噪声抑制（周期性/非周期性）、滤波算法等方面具有一定研究者；\n5、相关领域包括：棉绒填充、定量包装、检重分拣/分选等。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-02-29T12:30:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImg